<details class="rulebox"><summary>用語集 ─ NQSAR / Breadth / RS / LOO / MC57</summary><div class="rulebody"><b>NQSAR</b>：通常個別株の市場リスク状態。Blue/Greenは買付可能側、Yellowは新規停止、Redは通常株退避。<br><b>Breadth50</b>：通常株UniverseでClose&gt;SMA50の割合。市場の「上昇がどれだけ広がっているか」。<br><b>RS189 / RS63</b>：中期/短中期の相対強度Percentile。高いほどUniverse内で相対的に強い。<br><b>strict LOO</b>：候補自身をTheme計算から外す方式。自分の強さで自分のTheme点を水増ししない。<br><b>MC57</b>：57ETFを使った市場温度系。通常個別株のHard Gateではないが、TQQQ Panic Entry/Exitでは使用。</div></details>
</section>
<section id="positions" class="panel"><div class="card"><div class="hdr"><h2>通常個別株 Positions</h2><span class="badge">この端末に保存</span></div><div class="form"><input id="pt" placeholder="Ticker"><input id="pe" type="number" step="0.01" placeholder="Entry"><input id="pc" type="number" step="0.01" placeholder="Current Close"><button class="btn primary" id="addPos">追加</button></div><div class="note">すべて当日終値で判定し、注文は次営業日寄りで執行。Peakは最高終値のみ。部分利確後もEntryとPeak Closeをリセットしない。NQSAR Redが個別Stopより優先。</div><div id="positionList"></div></div></section>
<section id="detail" class="panel"><div class="card"><div class="hdr"><h2>市場・TQQQ 詳細</h2><span class="badge">監査用</span></div><div class="row"><div class="mini"><span>Market Mode</span><b id="mode">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Breadth / Coverage</span><b id="breadth">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>新規上限</span><b id="capacity">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Strict LOO</span><b id="looStatus">—</b></div></div><div class="row"><div class="mini"><span>Strict Seed (3条件AND)</span><b id="seed">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Seed Age</span><b id="seedAge">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>VIX</span><b id="vix">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>QQQ SMA50 ATR乖離</span><b id="atrDev">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>QQQ 10d DD</span><b id="dd10">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Stage56 Requested TQQQ</span><b id="requestedTarget">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Remaining Hold Days</span><b id="holdDays">—</b></div><div class="mini"><span>MC57 Active Exit</span><b id="mcExit">—</b></div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="hdr"><h2>Gross100 Allocation</h2><span class="badge">研究候補</span></div><div class="row"><div class="mini"><span>Reset Desired / Allocated</span><b id="resetAllocation">DATA REQUIRED</b></div><div class="mini"><span>TQQQ Protected / Extra</span><b id="tqqqParts">DATA REQUIRED</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Normal Desired / Allocated</span><b id="normalAllocation">DATA REQUIRED</b></div><div class="mini"><span>Final TQQQ / Gross</span><b id="executableTarget">DATA REQUIRED</b></div></div><div class="note" id="allocationNote">Reset → TQQQを競合時80%まで保護 → 通常株 → TQQQ Extra。未接続Sleeveは0扱いせずDATA REQUIRED。</div></div></section>
<section id="legacy" class="panel"><div class="card"><div class="hdr"><h2>既存Dashboard（変更なし）</h2><a class="link" href="command-center.html" target="_blank">別画面で開く →</a></div><div class="explain">既存Dashboardの表示・配色・ロジックは変更していません。</div><iframe class="legacy" src="command-center.html" title="Existing Command Center"></iframe></div></section>
</div>
<script>
const KEY='v38_audited_positions_v1';let STATE=null,TQQQ_STATE=null,ROT=null,ROTCTX=null;
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const fmt=(v,d=1)=>v==null?'—':Number(v).toFixed(d);const pct=v=>v==null?'—':Number(v).toFixed(1)+'%';const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
function openTab(id){document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('on',x.dataset.tab===id));document.querySelectorAll('.panel').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('on',x.id===id))}document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openTab(b.dataset.tab));
function positions(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY)||'[]')}catch{return[]}}function save(a){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(a));renderPositions();renderToday()}function finalStop(p){return Math.max(p.entry*.92,p.peak*.70)}function action(p){if(STATE?.market?.force_exit_next_open)return'NQSAR RED → 次回寄り全売却';if(p.current<=finalStop(p))return(p.entry*.92>=p.peak*.70?'−8% Stop':'Peak30')+' → 次回寄り売却';if(!p.partial&&p.current>=p.entry*1.24)return'+24% → 次回寄り25%利確';return'HOLD'}
function renderPositions(){let a=positions(),box=$('positionList');box.innerHTML=a.map((p,i)=>{p.peak=Math.max(+p.peak||+p.entry,+p.current);let act=action(p),ret=(p.current/p.entry-1)*100;return`<div class="pos"><div class="poshead"><b>${esc(p.ticker)}</b><b class="${ret>=0?'good':'bad'}">${ret>=0?'+':''}${ret.toFixed(1)}%</b></div><div class="lines">Entry $${p.entry.toFixed(2)} ／ Current $${p.current.toFixed(2)} ／ Peak Close $${p.peak.toFixed(2)}<br>Initial Stop $${(p.entry*.92).toFixed(2)} ／ Peak30 $${(p.peak*.70).toFixed(2)} ／ Final $${finalStop(p).toFixed(2)}<br>Partial25 ${p.partial?'済':'未'} ／ Remaining ${p.partial?75:100}% ／ <b>${act}</b></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" onclick="updateClose(${i})">終値更新</button><button class="btn" onclick="partial(${i})">25%利確済</button><button class="btn" onclick="removePos(${i})">削除</button></div></div>`}).join('')||'<div class="empty">保有記録なし</div>';localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(a))}
window.updateClose=i=>{let a=positions(),v=prompt('日次終値',a[i].current);if(v===null)return;v=+v;if(!(v>0))return;a[i].current=v;a[i].peak=Math.max(a[i].peak,v);save(a)};window.partial=i=>{let a=positions();a[i].partial=true;save(a)};window.removePos=i=>{let a=positions();a.splice(i,1);save(a)};$('addPos').onclick=()=>{let t=$('pt').value.trim().toUpperCase(),e=+$('pe').value,c=+$('pc').value;if(!t||!(e>0)||!(c>0))return;let a=positions();a.push({ticker:t,entry:e,current:c,peak:c,partial:false});save(a);$('pt').value=$('pe').value=$('pc').value=''};
function modeText(m){if(m.mode==='ATTACK')return['買える地合い','Blue/GreenかつBreadth 60%以上。通常株を最大12枠まで使える。','good'];if(m.mode==='SELECTIVE')return['選別して買える','Blue/GreenだがBreadthは50〜60%。通常株は合計最大4枠まで。','warn'];if(m.mode==='DEFENSE')return['防御モード','NQSAR Red。通常個別株は次回寄りで全退避。','bad'];return['新規買付を止める','通常株の新規Entry条件を満たしていない。既存株はRedでなければ個別Exitまで継続。','warn']}
function humanReason(m){if(m.mode==='STOP'&&String(m.nqsar).toLowerCase()==='yellow')return`NQSARがYellowのため新規買付停止。Breadth ${fmt(m.breadth50)}%はSELECTIVE水準ですが、Yellowが優先されます。`;if(m.mode==='DEFENSE')return'NQSARがRed。通常個別株は次回寄りで全退避します。';if(m.mode==='SELECTIVE')return`Breadth ${fmt(m.breadth50)}%。広がりが十分ではないため、強い銘柄だけ最大4枠に絞ります。`;if(m.mode==='ATTACK')return`Breadth ${fmt(m.breadth50)}%。市場の広がりも十分で、通常株を最大12枠まで使えます。`;return m.reason||'—'}
function rankRows(){if(!STATE)return[];let m=STATE.market,r=STATE.ranking||{},rows=[...(STATE.candidates||[])];if(m.mode==='SELECTIVE'||m.mode==='ATTACK')return rows.sort((a,b)=>(a.final_rank??999)-(b.final_rank??999));if(r.attack_watch_status==='READY')return rows.sort((a,b)=>(a.attack_watch_rank??999)-(b.attack_watch_rank??999));return rows}
function rankMeta(x){let m=STATE.market;if(m.mode==='SELECTIVE')return{rank:x.final_rank,score:x.rs189,label:'RS189'};if(m.mode==='ATTACK')return{rank:x.final_rank,score:x.attack_score,label:'V38 Final'};return{rank:x.attack_watch_rank,score:x.attack_watch_score,label:'再開時V38'}}
